          "_name": "news02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news02\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event Name\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Upcoming events</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Come join us to enjoy the beats, grab the fits, and vibe.</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-4 active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">October 26 – October, 2026</h5>\n\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>MAMC × \"REBEL CONCRETE\" Pop-Up Studio</b><br><br><br></h6>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">An immersive, high-altitude fashion experience bridging industrial concrete geometry with avant-garde streetwear. Step into a glass-enclosed cloud studio featuring private viewing rooms, exclusive SS27 pre-releases, and live DJ curation against the iconic KL skyline. By entry invitation only.<br><br>Venue: The Sky Arena, Grand Hyatt Kuala Lumpur&nbsp;<br></p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-4\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">November 14 – November 16, 2026</h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>MAMC \"STATIC NOISE\" Sound Station</b></h6>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">A midnight fusion of lo-fi static beats and heavy street style. We joins forces with local indie record stores to build a pop-up listening booth in the courtyard. Preview our new wave-rippled turtlenecks and faux-twinset tees while sipping craft beer. Exclusive MAMC zines and stickers given out with every purchase, while stocks last<br><br>Venue: The Courtyard @ The Zhongshan Building<br>\n        </p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n            Learn more\n          </a></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-4\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">December 05 – December 07, 2026</h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>MAMC \"CONCRETE CAFFEINE\" Pop-Up</b></h6>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Raw cement meets subverted cottagecore. We drops an aesthetic matte-black coffee truck in the heart of Bangsar. Pull up in any MAMC piece and grab a free signature 'Dark Plaid' cold brew. Catch the local first-drop of the 'Ruby Valley' off-shoulder tops and stripe twist shirts. Come grab a cup and shoot your next look.<br><br>Venue: APW Bangsar Courtyard&nbsp;<br>\n        </p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n            Learn more\n          </a></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxmaogjcP9",
          "_anchor": "news02-49",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
